Input: input
batch: $batch
height: 1
width: 11

FeedForward: l2
prev: input
out_dim: 10
intermediate_dim: 16
l1_act: sigmoid
rate1: 0.15
rate2: 0.15
bias: true
act: LeakyReLU

MHSA: mhsa

Input: target
batch: input->batch
height: 1
width: 10

Softmax: l2_sm 
dim: 0
prev: mhsa

L2Loss: loss
pred: l2_sm
tgt: target